Index Surgery Procedure Description:
Right hemicolectomy

Index Surgery Operative Note:
Right hemicolectomy for an obstructing mass. Due to borderline bowel perfusion, the bowel was left in discontinuity and the abdomen temporarily closed; a staged return to the OR was planned to complete the anastomosis and close the fascia.

Current Surgery Procedure Description:
Completion of anastomosis and abdominal closure

Current Surgery Operative Note:
Returned to the OR on postoperative day 3 as planned. Bowel viable. Anastomosis completed and fascia closed. Although this was within 30 days, it was a staged, pre-planned return.

